WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.290
Four students round a table.

2
00:00:02.340 --> 00:00:06.510
One question: should the school
library open on Saturdays?

3
00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:10.290
One of them talks, and talks, and talks.

4
00:00:10.340 --> 00:00:13.330
Speech bubbles pile up over everyone else.

5
00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:15.290
Another says very little.

6
00:00:15.340 --> 00:00:18.900
But every time they speak,
the others turn towards them.

7
00:00:18.950 --> 00:00:21.350
So who is the best speaker here?

8
00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:23.800
Is it really the one who talks most?

9
00:00:23.850 --> 00:00:26.820
In this mission, you'll map a
discussion about the library,

10
00:00:26.870 --> 00:00:29.350
and track who speaks to whom.

11
00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:31.330
Does the quietest person win, then?

12
00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:34.160
Or the loudest, most confident voice?

13
00:00:34.210 --> 00:00:36.940
And you'll step into a
role, and stay in it,

14
00:00:36.990 --> 00:00:39.140
even when someone challenges you.

15
00:00:39.190 --> 00:00:43.810
Your mission: decide whether the best
speaker is the one who talks most.
